  "title": "Explosion at the Sanctuary!",
  "description": "Garsa Fwip's Sanctuary was the premier watering hole and cantina in Mos Espa. She was a dutiful part of Boba Fett's retinue, paying him all the protection money he asked for without complaint. Her place was popular in the underworld, and she was easily loyal to whoever was in charge. But it was this that marked her establishment for destruction by the Pykes. In order to send a message, the Pykes infiltrated the Sanctuary with a camtono full of explosives and left it there, leaving Fwip to watch as her entire life burned to cinders."
